function actionPage(){return pageHead('Sales Action','จัดการแผนลูกค้ามีฐานและ Action ติดตาม · ตาราง / Kanban / ปฏิทิน',`<button class="btn primary" id="newAction">+ เพิ่ม Action</button>`)+filters(true)+`<div class="mode-tabs"><button data-action-mode="base" class="${actionMode==='base'?'active':''}">ลูกค้ามีฐาน · Plan รายสัปดาห์</button><button data-action-mode="followup" class="${actionMode==='followup'?'active':''}">ลูกค้าไม่มีฐาน / Prospect</button></div><div class="tabs"><button data-at="table" class="${actTab==='table'?'active':''}">ตาราง</button><button data-at="kanban" class="${actTab==='kanban'?'active':''}">Kanban</button><button data-at="calendar" class="${actTab==='calendar'?'active':''}">ปฏิทิน</button></div>${actionMode==='base'?weeklyPlansView():`<div class="card" id="actionContent"></div>`}`}
function weeklyPlansView(){const w=weeklyWeekSelection||nextPlanningWeek();return `<section class="weekly-toolbar"><div class="weekly-filter-group"><div class="field"><label>สัปดาห์</label><select id="weeklyWeek">${weekChoices().map(x=>`<option value="${x}" ${x===w?'selected':''}>${x.replace(/^W/,'WEEK ')}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Sale ที่ต้องการแสดง</label><select id="weeklySale"><option value="">ทั้งหมด</option>${active(rows('sales')).map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x.Sale_ID)}" ${weeklySaleSelection===x.Sale_ID?'selected':''}>${esc(x.Sale_Name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div><div class="weekly-action-groups"><div class="weekly-plan-actions"><button class="btn" id="cloneWeek">ดึงแผนสัปดาห์ก่อน</button><button class="btn primary" id="newWeekly">+ บันทึกแผนสัปดาห์</button></div><div class="weekly-file-actions"><button class="btn" id="weeklyImport">Import Excel</button><input type="file" id="weeklyUpload" accept=".xlsx,.xls,.csv" class="hidden"><button class="btn" id="weeklyTemplate">ดาวน์โหลด Template</button><button class="btn" id="weeklyExport">Export Excel</button></div></div></section><div class="card" id="actionContent"><div class="row space"><div><h3>ลูกค้าที่มีฐานการใช้</h3><div class="smallmuted">ทีมประสานงานขายบันทึกแผนได้หลายลูกค้าต่อครั้ง · Sale ดึงจาก Customer Master และแก้เป็นรายสัปดาห์ได้</div></div><span class="badge">Contact / Spot · UOM ตาม Master</span></div></div>`}
function weekChoices(){const set=new Set();for(let i=-10;i<=10;i++){const d=new Date(`${localToday()}T12:00:00`);d.setDate(d.getDate()+i*7);set.add(isoWeek(d.toISOString().slice(0,10)))}rows('weeklyPlans').forEach(x=>x.Week_Key&&set.add(x.Week_Key));return [...set].filter(Boolean).sort((a,b)=>{const x=toWeekRange(a).start,y=toWeekRange(b).start;return x.localeCompare(y)})}
function contactAcceptancePct(planMT,actualMT){const plan=Number(planMT||0);return plan>0?Number(actualMT||0)/plan*100:null}
function weeklyPlanTable(list){const byWeek=new Map();for(const p of list){const w=p.Week_Key||isoWeek(p.Plan_Date);if(!byWeek.has(w))byWeek.set(w,[]);byWeek.get(w).push(p)}return [...byWeek.entries()].sort((a,b)=>a[0].localeCompare(b[0])).map(([week,plans])=>{const range=toWeekRange(week),dates=Array.from({length:7},(_,i)=>{const d=new Date(`${range.start}T12:00:00Z`);d.setUTCDate(d.getUTCDate()+i);return d.toISOString().slice(0,10)}),groups=new Map();for(const p of plans){const item=rows('items').find(i=>i.Item_Code===p.Item_Code)||{},type=p.Product_Type||item.Product_Type||'',part=p.PART||item.PART||'',sub=p.SUB_PART||item.SUB_PART||'',key=[p.Sale_ID,p.Customer_Code,type,part,sub,p.Plan_Type||'Spot'].join('|');if(!groups.has(key))groups.set(key,{Sale_ID:p.Sale_ID,Customer_Code:p.Customer_Code,Product_Type:type,PART:part,SUB_PART:sub,Plan_Type:p.Plan_Type||'Spot',plans:[]});groups.get(key).plans.push(p)}const actualFor=(g,date)=>rows('actuals').filter(a=>a.Sale_ID===g.Sale_ID&&a.Customer_Code===g.Customer_Code&&normDate(a.Sales_Date)===date&&passesCommon(a,date)).filter(a=>{const i=rows('items').find(x=>x.Item_Code===a.Item_Code)||{};return i.Product_Type===g.Product_Type&&i.PART===g.PART&&i.SUB_PART===g.SUB_PART}).reduce((n,a)=>n+Number(a.Qty_MT||0),0);let totalP=0,totalA=0;const rowsHtml=[...groups.values()].map(g=>{const planFor=d=>g.plans.filter(p=>normDate(p.Plan_Date)===d).reduce((n,p)=>n+Number(p.Plan_MT||0),0),pSum=g.plans.reduce((n,p)=>n+Number(p.Plan_MT||0),0),aSum=dates.reduce((n,d)=>n+actualFor(g,d),0);totalP+=pSum;totalA+=aSum;return `<tr><td>${esc(g.Plan_Type==='Contact'?'Contract / Contact':'Spot รายวัน')}</td><td>${esc(rows('sales').find(s=>s.Sale_ID===g.Sale_ID)?.Sale_Name||g.Sale_ID)}</td><td>${esc(rows('customers').find(c=>c.Customer_Code===g.Customer_Code)?.Customer_Name||g.Customer_Code)}</td><td>${esc(g.Product_Type)}</td><td>${esc(g.PART)} / ${esc(g.SUB_PART)}</td>${dates.map(d=>`<td class="num">${fmt(planFor(d),3)}</td><td class="num actual-cell">${fmt(actualFor(g,d),3)}</td>`).join('')}<td class="num">${fmt(pSum,3)}</td><td class="num">${fmt(aSum,3)}</td><td class="num">${g.Plan_Type==='Contact'&&pSum?`${fmt(aSum/pSum*100,1)}%`:'—'}</td><td><div class="row nowrap">${g.plans.map(p=>`<button class="btn small" data-week-edit="${esc(p.Plan_ID)}" title="แก้ไข ${esc(normDate(p.Plan_Date))}">แก้ ${esc(normDate(p.Plan_Date).slice(-2))}</button>`).join('')}</div></td></tr>`}).join('');return `<section class="weekly-matrix-wrap"><div class="row space"><div><h3>${esc(week.replace(/^W/,'WEEK '))}</h3><div class="smallmuted">แสดง Plan / Actual รายวันเป็น MT · Actual รวมจาก Item ตาม Product Type / PART / SUB-PART · Contract acceptance = Actual ÷ Plan</div></div><div class="badge">รวม Plan ${fmt(totalP,3)} MT · Actual ${fmt(totalA,3)} MT</div></div><div class="tablewrap"><table class="compact-table weekly-matrix"><thead><tr><th rowspan="2">ประเภทแผน</th><th rowspan="2">Sale</th><th rowspan="2">Customer</th><th rowspan="2">Product Type</th><th rowspan="2">PART / SUB-PART</th>${dates.map(d=>`<th colspan="2">${esc(`${d.slice(8,10)}/${d.slice(5,7)}/${d.slice(0,4)}`)}</th>`).join('')}<th rowspan="2">Plan รวม</th><th rowspan="2">Actual รวม</th><th rowspan="2">Contract %</th><th rowspan="2">แก้ไข</th></tr><tr>${dates.map(()=>`<th>Plan</th><th>Actual</th>`).join('')}</tr></thead><tbody>${rowsHtml||`<tr><td colspan="23" class="empty">ยังไม่มีแผนในสัปดาห์ที่เลือก</td></tr>`}</tbody><tfoot><tr><th colspan="5">รวมรายวัน (MT)</th>${dates.map(d=>`<th class="num">${fmt(plans.filter(p=>normDate(p.Plan_Date)===d).reduce((n,p)=>n+Number(p.Plan_MT||0),0),3)}</th><th class="num">${fmt([...groups.values()].reduce((n,g)=>n+actualFor(g,d),0),3)}</th>`).join('')}<th>${fmt(totalP,3)}</th><th>${fmt(totalA,3)}</th><th>${totalP?`${fmt(totalA/totalP*100,1)}%`:'—'}</th><th></th></tr></tfoot></table></div></section>`}).join('')}

function priorWeeklyMetrics(week,saleId,customerCode,type,part,sub){const r=toWeekRange(week);if(!r.start)return {week:'',planMT:0,actualMT:0};const d=new Date(`${r.start}T12:00:00Z`);d.setUTCDate(d.getUTCDate()-7);const prior=isoWeek(d.toISOString().slice(0,10)),live=x=>String(x.Data_Status||'LIVE').toUpperCase()==='LIVE',category=x=>{const i=rows('items').find(a=>a.Item_Code===x.Item_Code)||{};return [x.Product_Type||i.Product_Type||'',x.PART||i.PART||'',x.SUB_PART||i.SUB_PART||'']};const plans=rows('weeklyPlans').filter(x=>live(x)&&x.Week_Key===prior&&x.Sale_ID===saleId&&x.Customer_Code===customerCode&&category(x).join('|')===[type,part,sub].join('|'));const dates=toWeekRange(prior);const actual=rows('actuals').filter(x=>live(x)&&x.Sale_ID===saleId&&x.Customer_Code===customerCode&&normDate(x.Sales_Date)>=dates.start&&normDate(x.Sales_Date)<=dates.end&&category(x).join('|')===[type,part,sub].join('|'));return {week:prior,planMT:plans.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.Plan_MT||0),0),actualMT:actual.reduce((n,x)=>n+Number(x.Qty_MT||0),0)}}
function updateWeeklyPreviousMetric(row){const week=$('#wWeek')?.value,customerCode=row.querySelector('[data-w-customer]')?.value,customer=rows('customers').find(c=>c.Customer_Code===customerCode),saleId=row.querySelector('[data-w-sale]')?.value||customer?.Assigned_Sale_ID,type=row.querySelector('[data-w-product-type]')?.value,part=row.querySelector('[data-w-part]')?.value,sub=row.querySelector('[data-w-subpart]')?.value,box=row.querySelector('[data-w-prev-metric]');if(!box)return;if(!week||!saleId||!customerCode||!type||!part||!sub){box.textContent='เลือก/ตรวจ Sale, ลูกค้า และกลุ่มสินค้าเพื่อดู Plan / Actual สัปดาห์ก่อน';return}const m=priorWeeklyMetrics(week,saleId,customerCode,type,part,sub);box.innerHTML=`สัปดาห์ก่อน ${esc(m.week)} · Plan ${fmt(m.planMT,3)} MT · Actual ${fmt(m.actualMT,3)} MT`}
function weekRowHTML(o={},n=0){const oldItem=rows('items').find(i=>i.Item_Code===o.Item_Code)||{},type=o.Product_Type||oldItem.Product_Type||'',part=o.PART||oldItem.PART||'',sub=o.SUB_PART||oldItem.SUB_PART||'',groups=categoryMasterRows(),customer=rows('customers').find(c=>c.Customer_Code===o.Customer_Code)||{},defaultSale=o.Sale_ID||customer.Assigned_Sale_ID||'';return `<div class="plan-entry weekly-entry" data-week-row="${n}"><div class="row space"><b>ลูกค้าและกลุ่มสินค้า ${n+1}</b><button type="button" class="btn small danger" data-remove-week>ลบรายการ</button></div><div class="formgrid"><div class="field"><label>ประเภทแผน</label><select data-w-type><option value="Contact" ${o.Plan_Type==='Contact'?'selected':''}>Contact</option><option value="Spot" ${o.Plan_Type==='Spot'?'selected':''}>Spot รายวัน</option></select></div><div class="field"><label>ลูกค้า</label><select data-w-customer>${active(rows('customers')).map(c=>`<option value="${esc(c.Customer_Code)}" ${o.Customer_Code===c.Customer_Code?'selected':''}>${esc(c.Customer_Name)} · ${esc(c.Customer_Code)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Sale ผู้ดูแล (จาก Customer Master แก้ได้)</label><select data-w-sale><option value="">เลือก Sale</option>${active(rows('sales')).map(x=>`<option value="${esc(x.Sale_ID)}" ${x.Sale_ID===defaultSale?'selected':''}>${esc(x.Sale_Name)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>Product Type</label><select data-w-product-type><option value="">เลือก Product Type</option>${[...new Set(groups.map(g=>g.Product_Type).filter(Boolean))].map(x=>`<option ${x===type?'selected':''}>${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>PART</label><select data-w-part><option value="">เลือก PART</option>${[...new Set(groups.filter(g=>!type||g.Product_Type===type).map(g=>g.PART).filter(Boolean))].map(x=>`<option ${x===part?'selected':''}>${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>SUB-PART</label><select data-w-subpart><option value="">เลือก SUB-PART</option>${[...new Set(groups.filter(g=>(!type||g.Product_Type===type)&&(!part||g.PART===part)).map(g=>g.SUB_PART).filter(Boolean))].map(x=>`<option ${x===sub?'selected':''}>${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div class="field"><label>วันที่ตามคิว</label><input data-w-date type="date" value="${esc(normDate(o.Plan_Date)||localToday())}"></div><div class="field"><label>จำนวน Plan</label><input data-w-qty type="number" min="0" step="0.001" value="${esc(o.Plan_Qty||'')}"></div><div class="field"><label>หน่วย Plan (Master)</label><select data-w-uom>${groupUomOptions(type,part,sub,o.Plan_UOM)}</select></div></div><div class="notice weekly-prior-metric" data-w-prev-metric>Plan / Actual สัปดาห์ก่อน</div><div class="smallmuted weekly-uom-note">Plan ระดับกลุ่มสินค้า · Actual รวมจาก Item ในกลุ่มเดียวกัน</div></div>`}
function bindWeekRows(){document.querySelectorAll('[data-remove-week]').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>b.closest('[data-week-row]').remove());document.querySelectorAll('[data-w-product-type]').forEach(s=>s.onchange=()=>{const row=s.closest('[data-week-row]');fillWeeklyRowGroups(row,'type');updateWeeklyPreviousMetric(row)});document.querySelectorAll('[data-w-part]').forEach(s=>s.onchange=()=>{const row=s.closest('[data-week-row]');fillWeeklyRowGroups(row,'part');updateWeeklyPreviousMetric(row)});document.querySelectorAll('[data-w-subpart]').forEach(s=>s.onchange=()=>{const row=s.closest('[data-week-row]');fillWeeklyRowGroups(row,'sub');updateWeeklyPreviousMetric(row)});document.querySelectorAll('[data-w-customer]').forEach(s=>s.onchange=()=>{const row=s.closest('[data-week-row]'),c=rows('customers').find(x=>x.Customer_Code===s.value),sale=row.querySelector('[data-w-sale]');sale.value=c?.Assigned_Sale_ID||'';updateWeeklyPreviousMetric(row)});document.querySelectorAll('[data-w-sale]').forEach(s=>s.onchange=()=>updateWeeklyPreviousMetric(s.closest('[data-week-row]')));document.querySelectorAll('[data-week-row]').forEach(r=>{fillWeeklyRowGroups(r,'sub');const c=rows('customers').find(x=>x.Customer_Code===r.querySelector('[data-w-customer]')?.value),sale=r.querySelector('[data-w-sale]');if(sale&&!sale.value&&c?.Assigned_Sale_ID)sale.value=c.Assigned_Sale_ID;updateWeeklyPreviousMetric(r)})}
function fillWeeklyRowGroups(row,changed){const type=row.querySelector('[data-w-product-type]').value,partSel=row.querySelector('[data-w-part]'),subSel=row.querySelector('[data-w-subpart]'),uomSel=row.querySelector('[data-w-uom]'),customerSel=row.querySelector('[data-w-customer]'),groups=categoryMasterRows(),oldSub=subSel.value,oldUom=uomSel.value,oldCustomer=customerSel.value;if(changed==='type'){const parts=[...new Set(groups.filter(g=>!type||g.Product_Type===type).map(g=>g.PART).filter(Boolean))];partSel.innerHTML=`<option value="">เลือก PART</option>${parts.map(x=>`<option>${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}`}const part=partSel.value;if(changed!=='sub'){const subs=[...new Set(groups.filter(g=>(!type||g.Product_Type===type)&&(!part||g.PART===part)).map(g=>g.SUB_PART).filter(Boolean))];subSel.innerHTML=`<option value="">เลือก SUB-PART</option>${subs.map(x=>`<option ${x===oldSub?'selected':''}>${esc(x)}</option>`).join('')}`}const sub=subSel.value;uomSel.innerHTML=groupUomOptions(type,part,sub,oldUom);customerSel.innerHTML=customerLovOptionsForGroup(type,part,sub,oldCustomer)}
function weeklyGroupProduct(type,part,sub,value){const t=rows('productTypes').find(x=>String(x.Product_Type)===String(type)),p=rows('parts').find(x=>String(x.PART)===String(part)),sp=rows('subParts').find(x=>String(x.SUB_PART)===String(sub)&&String(x.PART_ID)===String(p?.PART_ID)),matches=active(rows('groupProducts')).filter(g=>String(g.Product_Type_ID)===String(t?.Product_Type_ID)&&String(g.PART_ID)===String(p?.PART_ID)&&String(g.SUB_PART_ID)===String(sp?.SUB_PART_ID));const gp=matches.find(g=>String(g.Group_Product_Name)===String(value)||String(g.Group_Product_ID)===String(value));if(value&&!gp)throw Error('Group Product ต้องตรงกับ Master และสัมพันธ์กับ Product Type / PART / SUB-PART');if(!gp&&matches.length===1)return matches[0];if(!gp&&matches.length>1)throw Error('พบ Group Product มากกว่า 1 รายการในชุดกลุ่มสินค้านี้');if(!gp)throw Error('ไม่พบ Group Product ที่สัมพันธ์กับ Product Type / PART / SUB-PART ใน Master');return gp}
